1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:30,000
= kisskh.asia =

2
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,555
=Against The Current=

3
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,156
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,906
=Episode 18= (This drama does not correspond)

5
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,186
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,290
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
00:01:43,079 --> 00:01:43,736
Young Master!

8
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:44,760
Watch out!

9
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,120
Cuique.

10
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,519
Don't be afraid.

11
00:02:16,639 --> 00:02:17,895
Let Yinchen and Wei

12
00:02:17,919 --> 00:02:20,160
take you to Aunt Shunhua's Rongzhang House.

13
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,816
Once the imperial physician arrives,

14
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:23,239
you'll get better.

15
00:02:24,199 --> 00:02:25,560
Don't worry about me.

16
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:28,840
I'm staying with First Madam and Xiushu.

17
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:35,199
First Madam's household authority tokens and seal

18
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,600
are all here.

19
00:02:37,599 --> 00:02:38,720
As for this matter,

20
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,680
Lanxiang, you handle it.

21
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:49,840
Du Cuique,

22
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,799
hand over the antidote.

23
00:02:54,872 --> 00:02:55,936
What are you talking about?

24
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,160
I don't understand.

25
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,135
Aren't you curious

26
00:03:00,159 --> 00:03:01,880
how you were poisoned?

27
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:09,160
Even if I've acted improperly in the past

28
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,720
and offended you,

29
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:13,175
look at the state I'm in now.

30
00:03:13,199 --> 00:03:14,759
I'm already pitiful enough.

31
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,359
Lanxiang,

32
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:17,496
why must you

33
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:19,560
make things harder for someone in my condition?

34
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,160
You must have guessed

35
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:24,560
there was something wrong with the tea you drank earlier.

36
00:03:25,759 --> 00:03:27,216
But do you know where

37
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,959
the poison in the tea came from?

38
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,160
Last night,

39
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,855
Young Master didn't bathe at all

40
00:03:35,879 --> 00:03:37,199
before going out.

41
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,759
The water used to make your tea

42
00:03:42,039 --> 00:03:44,600
was the hot water you prepared for Young Master.

43
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:49,160
Baogai reheated it and made tea with it.

44
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:51,560
Gantang served it right back to you.

45
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:57,759
You thought Young Master had already fallen ill and lost consciousness.

46
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:00,816
You thought if you could just hold out a little longer,

47
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:02,560
someone would come to save you.

48
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:04,816
Young Lady Du,

49
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,000
I'm sorry

50
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:07,600
to disappoint you.

51
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:11,280
Young Master is perfectly well and out there right now.

52
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,615
He may even be dealing with

53
00:04:13,639 --> 00:04:16,800
the benefactor who gave you the Yunzi stones and Xinggu gauze.

54
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,360
You...

55
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,199
You're wondering how I know

56
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,800
and how much I know?

57
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,480
When you were bent on climbing higher,

58
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:35,000
you never bothered to look down.

59
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,880
But everything you eat, wear, and use

60
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,576
passes through the hands of

61
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,199
lowly maids like us.

62
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,759
We saw it all.

63
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:47,519
You had Lingdang poison the hot water.

64
00:04:47,759 --> 00:04:49,199
Tongcao saw it.

65
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:51,759
You accepted the Yunzi stones.

66
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,639
Xiaolian saw it.

67
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:56,120
You wore an undershirt made of Xinggu gauze.

68
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,279
Gantang saw it.

69
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:07,439
Xiuwan!

70
00:05:10,199 --> 00:05:12,016
Zheng saved Jinqi's life.

71
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,960
Cuique is an honored guest of our Lin Residence.

72
00:05:14,664 --> 00:05:16,696
You lowly maid, how dare you spout such nonsense

73
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,120
and make these vicious accusations!

74
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,615
I'll slap that mouth of yours bloody!

75
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:20,759
Xiuwan.

76
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,759
They're not good people at all.

77
00:05:26,519 --> 00:05:27,920
I saw it.

78
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,279
The cave beneath Enduring the Cold Pavilion.

79
00:05:43,439 --> 00:05:44,959
You helped Du Cuique.

80
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,656
What is she to you?

81
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,240
Did you ever think about us?

82
00:05:48,399 --> 00:05:49,375
If you do that,

83
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:51,055
what will happen to Xiushu and me?

84
00:05:51,079 --> 00:05:52,639
What about our eldest sister?

85
00:05:57,439 --> 00:05:58,439
Xiuwan.

86
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,600
Jinqiao.

87
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,560
Go bring your sister back.

88
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:22,008
To create the illusion of an epidemic,

89
00:06:22,072 --> 00:06:24,390
you always administered the poison through the bathwater.

90
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,399
But when you realized

91
00:06:26,439 --> 00:06:27,495
I suspected you,

92
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:29,120
you killed Lingdang.

93
00:06:33,319 --> 00:06:34,719
If I'm right,

94
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,375
the poison you gave Lingdang

95
00:06:36,399 --> 00:06:38,159
was put in her food.

96
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:40,959
She ate it without suspecting a thing.

97
00:06:43,639 --> 00:06:44,759
Lanxiang.

98
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,615
I simply did the same

99
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:50,320
and made tea with the water

100
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:52,880
you poisoned for you to drink.

101
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:55,959
You want to outlast First Madam,

102
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,560
but can you?

103
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,480
First Madam didn't ingest the poison.

104
00:07:05,439 --> 00:07:06,680
Du Cuique,

105
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,696
you're exceptionally talented and meticulous.

106
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:11,480
What a brilliant strategist you are.

107
00:07:11,752 --> 00:07:12,935
Now that it's come to this,

108
00:07:12,959 --> 00:07:14,839
why lose your dignity by denying it?

109
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,920
Congyi saved Jinqi's life.

110
00:07:17,639 --> 00:07:19,055
As long as you hand over the antidote

111
00:07:19,079 --> 00:07:20,279
and everyone is safe,

112
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:23,000
I promise the Lin family won't pursue the matter.

113
00:07:23,639 --> 00:07:25,880
We'll consider your lifesaving favor repaid.

114
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,360
That's right.

115
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,480
This isn't an illness.

116
00:07:35,959 --> 00:07:37,079
It's poison.

117
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:41,000
I poisoned them.

118
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,240
The antidote?

119
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:52,079
I don't have it.

120
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:02,599
I never expected to be poisoned myself.

121
00:08:02,839 --> 00:08:05,560
Why would I prepare an antidote?

122
00:08:07,199 --> 00:08:08,320
However,

123
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:11,480
I do have the formula for the antidote.

124
00:08:14,439 --> 00:08:16,279
Hand over the formula.

125
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:22,560
What do you take me for?

126
00:08:23,639 --> 00:08:25,920
Some petty thief?

127
00:08:26,519 --> 00:08:28,815
You think poisoning me

128
00:08:28,839 --> 00:08:30,615
will frighten me out of my wits

129
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:33,160
and force me to hand over the antidote to save my life?

130
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:37,359
Xu Lanxiang,

131
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:40,959
you've misjudged me.

132
00:08:44,519 --> 00:08:45,895
Since I chose this path,

133
00:08:45,919 --> 00:08:47,520
I was never afraid.

134
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,735
I'm not afraid to take another's life,

135
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:53,959
much less have someone take mine.

136
00:09:06,639 --> 00:09:08,400
You need the antidote,

137
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:11,135
so you didn't dare give me a heavy dose

138
00:09:11,159 --> 00:09:13,520
in case I died like Lingdang.

139
00:09:15,559 --> 00:09:17,959
No matter how desperate I become,

140
00:09:18,519 --> 00:09:19,959
that Yuchan

141
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:22,400
will die before I do.

142
00:09:23,919 --> 00:09:27,160
But Yuchan has no grievance with me.

143
00:09:28,039 --> 00:09:30,520
I never intended to kill her.

144
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,999
The one I wanted dead

145
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,400
was you.

146
00:09:36,039 --> 00:09:37,039
She

147
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:40,199
is dying in your place.

148
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,375
That wretched old woman Qin

149
00:09:55,399 --> 00:09:57,079
looked down on me, didn't she?

150
00:09:57,559 --> 00:09:58,559
Fine.

151
00:09:59,639 --> 00:10:02,359
Then she can die with her daughter and keep me company.

152
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:04,959
Even if Lin Jinqi is alive,

153
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,680
what difference does it make?

154
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,576
He caused his mother's death

155
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:10,280
and his sister's death.

156
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,239
For the rest of his life,

157
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:15,800
does he think he'll ever live in peace?

158
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,375
What are you after?

159
00:10:20,399 --> 00:10:21,680
What am I after?

160
00:10:23,759 --> 00:10:26,560
How could the small-minded understand great ambitions?

161
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,680
With so many people in the Lin Residence

162
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,680
dying along with me,

163
00:10:35,559 --> 00:10:37,040
I'd say it's worth it.

164
00:10:39,639 --> 00:10:41,040
But Xu Lanxiang,

165
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,680
remember this.

166
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:45,079
You're the one who poisoned me.

167
00:10:45,399 --> 00:10:47,760
That's why they won't get the antidote.

168
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,359
They

169
00:10:52,399 --> 00:10:54,760
will all die because of you.

170
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,719
You're wrong.

171
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:30,560
I saved them.

172
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:34,320
The only person you can poison to death

173
00:11:35,039 --> 00:11:36,440
is yourself.

174
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,959
- First Madam!
- First Madam!

175
00:12:55,159 --> 00:12:56,760
Thanks to Lanxiang,

176
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,920
we got the antidote.

177
00:12:59,919 --> 00:13:01,800
Concubine Zhou and I were only mildly poisoned.

178
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,560
We recovered after taking the antidote.

179
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,895
The others were more severely poisoned.

180
00:13:05,919 --> 00:13:08,280
They'll need some time to recuperate,

181
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:10,479
but they're all out of danger now.

182
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,239
How...

183
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,800
How can this be?

184
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:26,176
Impossible.

185
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,520
Last night,

186
00:13:27,639 --> 00:13:29,976
Lanxiang had Nanke take the poisoned water

187
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,719
to the Imperial Medical Service.

188
00:13:31,896 --> 00:13:33,326
Your poisoning method may be devious

189
00:13:33,350 --> 00:13:36,056
and based on a secret technique from the southern borderlands,

190
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:37,735
but this is Jinling, the Southern Capital,

191
00:13:37,759 --> 00:13:39,400
where skilled experts abound.

192
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:42,959
The Imperial Medical Service even has a physician from Yunnan Prefecture.

193
00:13:43,159 --> 00:13:44,735
Once they had a sample of your poison,

194
00:13:44,759 --> 00:13:47,079
how could they fail to formulate an antidote?

195
00:13:47,399 --> 00:13:48,375
Right now,

196
00:13:48,399 --> 00:13:50,800
they're busy treating the patients in Fengqi Courtyard.

197
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,080
Later,

198
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:54,599
they'd also like to compare notes with you.

199
00:14:00,559 --> 00:14:02,336
Please apologize to the imperial physicians

200
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:04,160
on my behalf.

201
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:07,760
I'm afraid I'll have to leave first.

202
00:14:08,559 --> 00:14:10,640
I won't have time to speak with them.

203
00:14:12,472 --> 00:14:14,190
Ever since you entered this residence,

204
00:14:14,559 --> 00:14:16,999
I've never treated you unfairly.

205
00:14:17,559 --> 00:14:20,479
Even though I didn't want you to become Jinqi's concubine,

206
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:23,615
I still looked everywhere for a well-off family for you

207
00:14:23,639 --> 00:14:25,879
and tried to arrange a good marriage for you.

208
00:14:26,639 --> 00:14:27,719
Why do you

209
00:14:28,559 --> 00:14:30,959
hate our Lin family so much?

210
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,599
A well-off family?

211
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:36,479
A good marriage?

212
00:14:37,639 --> 00:14:39,320
Let me guess.

213
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,920
It would probably be

214
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:45,560
a farming family with some land of their own.

215
00:14:50,759 --> 00:14:52,280
A family like that

216
00:14:52,519 --> 00:14:54,959
would have struggled to put one son through his studies.

217
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:57,816
He couldn't marry a proper young lady from a prominent family,

218
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,680
but then along comes someone like me,

219
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:02,359
someone with ties to the Lin Residence.

220
00:15:03,919 --> 00:15:05,560
Once I married into the family,

221
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:07,400
I'd have to manage the household,

222
00:15:07,639 --> 00:15:08,735
be a dutiful daughter-in-law,

223
00:15:08,759 --> 00:15:11,119
bear and raise children, get along with my sisters-in-law,

224
00:15:11,639 --> 00:15:13,976
and use my ties to the Lin Residence

225
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:16,199
to help my husband build connections.

226
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,119
I might even

227
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:22,936
have to spend my entire dowry

228
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:25,255
to help my husband rise through the ranks.

229
00:15:25,279 --> 00:15:26,279
This is

230
00:15:27,039 --> 00:15:29,680
what you call a good marriage?

231
00:15:31,799 --> 00:15:33,560
What's wrong with that?

232
00:15:33,992 --> 00:15:36,760
Don't you want your husband to rise in rank and become an official?

233
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:38,216
If I want wealth and status,

234
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:40,320
why would I marry into a family like that?

235
00:15:42,639 --> 00:15:44,199
Am I out of my mind?

236
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,615
I'd bring my dowry with me

237
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:48,520
only to work myself to the bone for them.

238
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:51,800
If I have to marry anyway,

239
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,760
I'll marry into a wealthy and powerful family.

240
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:57,599
If the Lin family won't accept me,

241
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:00,760
another prominent family will.

242
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:06,560
Water flows downward, while people strive to rise.

243
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:09,336
There's nothing wrong with wanting

244
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,560
success, wealth, and status.

245
00:16:10,759 --> 00:16:12,959
But you shouldn't resort to underhanded means!

246
00:16:19,759 --> 00:16:22,199
Then let me ask you, First Madam,

247
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:24,375
what other open road is there

248
00:16:24,399 --> 00:16:26,160
for someone like me?

249
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:31,119
My talent and learning are no less than any man's.

250
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:36,760
But can I take the imperial examination and become the top scholar?

251
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:40,160
Or can I join the army and win a noble title through battle?

252
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:44,280
Other than marriage,

253
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:48,119
what other path has this world

254
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:51,160
left for a woman like me?

255
00:16:54,159 --> 00:16:55,800
Haven't you simply decided

256
00:16:56,519 --> 00:16:58,959
that marrying me off well

257
00:16:59,639 --> 00:17:03,359
would repay my brother for saving Jinqi's life?

258
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:08,960
What's wrong with getting married?

259
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,616
What else can a woman do

260
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:13,200
if she doesn't marry?

261
00:17:15,759 --> 00:17:17,000
How pitiful.

262
00:17:18,759 --> 00:17:20,520
How truly pitiful.

263
00:17:22,519 --> 00:17:24,560
You really are pitiful.

264
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,760
What are you laughing at?

265
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:38,000
What's so wrong with getting married?

266
00:17:39,640 --> 00:17:41,159
What's so pitiful about it?

267
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:20,359
A woman was born amid the chaos of the previous dynasty.

268
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:23,320
At twelve or thirteen, she was sold as a child bride.

269
00:18:24,039 --> 00:18:26,616
Unable to endure her in-laws' abuse,

270
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:27,616
she ran away

271
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:29,000
and eventually ended up in Yazhou.

272
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:31,639
But she never gave up on herself.

273
00:18:31,759 --> 00:18:34,159
She learned weaving from the local women

274
00:18:34,279 --> 00:18:35,879
and worked hard to support herself.

275
00:18:41,759 --> 00:18:43,320
A woman like that

276
00:18:44,359 --> 00:18:46,000
would drift aimlessly

277
00:18:46,279 --> 00:18:48,040
or live a life of drudgery.

278
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:50,815
After she passed away,

279
