561
00:40:21,920 --> 00:40:25,519
just because you want a better life.

562
00:40:35,039 --> 00:40:37,240
I don't think I did anything wrong, either.

563
00:40:42,199 --> 00:40:43,720
But why

564
00:40:46,559 --> 00:40:48,320
do I still feel so awful?

565
00:40:54,159 --> 00:40:55,640
Because

566
00:40:57,800 --> 00:40:58,919
you

567
00:41:00,159 --> 00:41:02,320
are a good person.

568
00:41:05,740 --> 00:41:12,260
♪ If you're a lone traveler returning through the snow ♪

569
00:41:18,400 --> 00:41:20,280
I'm a good person...

570
00:41:24,780 --> 00:41:28,900
♪ If you're the silent fragrance of a secluded orchid ♪

571
00:41:33,039 --> 00:41:34,600
I like hearing that.

572
00:41:35,559 --> 00:41:36,535
Say it some more...

573
00:41:36,559 --> 00:41:41,660
♪ Deep within the lights lies a truth that came too late ♪

574
00:41:43,940 --> 00:41:48,976
♪ Even if these trials consume my whole life ♪

575
00:41:49,000 --> 00:41:50,055
You're really drunk.

576
00:41:50,079 --> 00:41:53,396
♪ I'll only return to the moment our fate began ♪

577
00:41:53,420 --> 00:41:57,036
♪ I've searched and searched, wandering in circles ♪

578
00:41:57,060 --> 00:41:59,996
♪ Yet I can never mend that old dream ♪

579
00:42:00,020 --> 00:42:02,956
♪ Leaving only regret behind ♪

580
00:42:02,980 --> 00:42:07,860
♪ Thankfully, these trials have spared me a lifetime ♪

581
00:42:07,900 --> 00:42:13,300
♪ In this life and the next, it will always be you ♪

582
00:42:13,700 --> 00:42:21,700
♪ I only pray that fate lets us meet sooner ♪

583
00:42:35,940 --> 00:42:38,780
(Your pay and provisions come from the people's toil.)

584
00:42:41,320 --> 00:42:44,280
Liang Yu, Commander of the Shence Garrison,

585
00:42:44,760 --> 00:42:46,600
has enjoyed His Majesty's favor,

586
00:42:47,039 --> 00:42:49,015
yet gave no thought to serving the realm.

587
00:42:49,039 --> 00:42:50,919
He colluded with Dai Rong

588
00:42:51,039 --> 00:42:53,120
and formed a faction for personal gain.

589
00:42:53,440 --> 00:42:54,896
He disregarded the greater good

590
00:42:54,920 --> 00:42:56,720
and pursued his own interests.

591
00:42:57,239 --> 00:43:01,359
He is hereby stripped of office and imprisoned.

592
00:43:05,060 --> 00:43:07,780
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

593
00:43:08,056 --> 00:43:10,336
First Madam, Young Master, for all you've done for us,

594
00:43:10,360 --> 00:43:12,736
our whole family will always remember your kindness.

595
00:43:12,760 --> 00:43:14,456
Every day, we'll kowtow to the Bodhisattva

596
00:43:14,480 --> 00:43:16,086
and pray for the Bodhisattva's blessings.

597
00:43:16,110 --> 00:43:17,936
May First Madam be blessed with many descendants

598
00:43:17,960 --> 00:43:19,392
and an ever-flourishing family line.

599
00:43:19,416 --> 00:43:21,495
May Young Master be blessed with a destined match

600
00:43:21,519 --> 00:43:22,919
and a marriage made in heaven.

601
00:43:26,239 --> 00:43:27,039
Yes.

602
00:43:27,079 --> 00:43:29,640
Every day, we'll kowtow and burn incense to the Bodhisattva

603
00:43:29,679 --> 00:43:30,535
and pray for the Bodhisattva's blessings.

604
00:43:30,559 --> 00:43:31,135
May...

605
00:43:31,159 --> 00:43:32,879
May the Bodhisattva bless you.

606
00:43:34,440 --> 00:43:35,999
You certainly have a way with words.

607
00:43:36,440 --> 00:43:37,640
What you said

608
00:43:37,760 --> 00:43:39,680
is exactly what First Madam and I wish for.

609
00:43:40,392 --> 00:43:41,856
May your auspicious words come true.

610
00:43:41,880 --> 00:43:43,120
I hope that someday,

611
00:43:43,230 --> 00:43:44,984
everything will turn out just as we wish.

612
00:44:01,461 --> 00:44:05,581
♪ Spring slips from the branches once more ♪

613
00:44:08,421 --> 00:44:12,941
♪ Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before ♪

614
00:44:14,221 --> 00:44:18,141
♪ All the joys and sorrows come and go ♪

615
00:44:18,821 --> 00:44:21,581
♪ While loss leaves winter in the heart ♪

616
00:44:22,301 --> 00:44:24,597
♪ Though all the world may fade ♪

617
00:44:24,621 --> 00:44:27,701
♪ Time rolls on as countless lives rush by ♪

618
00:44:29,221 --> 00:44:33,461
♪ Night winds wander through the halls of long ago ♪

619
00:44:36,381 --> 00:44:40,541
♪ No page could hold the longing words can never show ♪

620
00:44:42,341 --> 00:44:45,877
♪ Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life ♪

621
00:44:45,901 --> 00:44:49,461
♪ Fades into the past as new wounds rise ♪

622
00:44:50,261 --> 00:44:55,941
♪ While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves ♪

623
00:44:56,301 --> 00:45:00,621
♪ Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall ♪

624
00:45:00,981 --> 00:45:03,917
♪ Let sorrow spill like shadows over all ♪

625
00:45:03,941 --> 00:45:07,677
♪ Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away ♪

626
00:45:07,701 --> 00:45:10,557
♪ Let the past die with yesterday ♪

627
00:45:10,581 --> 00:45:14,637
♪ One last fire, one last cup of wine ♪

628
00:45:14,661 --> 00:45:17,997
♪ And silver moonlight to guide me through the night ♪

629
00:45:18,021 --> 00:45:21,757
♪ Let beginnings fade as endings come to call ♪

630
00:45:21,781 --> 00:45:25,781
♪ From this endless dream, there's no return at all ♪

631
00:45:26,541 --> 00:45:30,677
♪ Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall ♪

632
